      "description": "Image frame and unboxed product information; preview intentionally omits product photography.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><a class=\"ds-card-image\" href=\"#produto\" aria-label=\"Ver produto\"><span class=\"ds-tag\">Exemplo demonstrativo</span></a><div class=\"ds-card-body\"><div><span class=\"ds-label\">Casa</span><h3>Produto de exemplo</h3><p>Informações do produto</p></div><div class=\"ds-price\"><strong>R$ 00,00</strong><small>Preço demonstrativo</small></div></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{max-width:540px;font-family:var(--body);color:var(--ink)}.ds-card-image{display:block;position:relative;aspect-ratio:1.22;background:var(--peach);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}.ds-card-image:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--coral);outline-offset:4px}.ds-tag{position:absolute;top:18px;left:18px;font-size:12px;background:var(--paper);padding:7px 10px;border-radius:6px}.ds-card-body{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding-top:20px}.ds-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ds-card h3{font-size:21px;line-height:1.15;margin:6px 0 0;font-weight:700}.ds-card p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:7px 0 0}.ds-price{text-align:right;flex-shrink:0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-price strong{display:block;font-size:22px;line-height:1.2;margin-top:22px}.ds-price small{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:7px}"
